  "dct_description_sm": [
    "The Canada/US management plan for snow geese aims to reduce the population until there is evidence of no further change and the beginnings of recovery.  We annually monitor exclosures erected in completed denuded habitat to ascertain if anything will recover in the absence of snow geese and, if so, the time course and successional composition of any recovery."
